hdl/ieee1722/aaf/KL_tdm_capture_master.sv:KL_tdm_capture_master: BCLK_HALF_P — documented in cycles, not named for it: clk_audio_i cycles per bclk HALF period. bclk = clk_audio_i/(2*this). 24.576 MHz / 2 = 12.288 MHz = TDM8 x 32 bits x 48 kHz, so 1 is the shipping value. Never 0 - that would ask for a clock, not a divider.
