hdl/ieee8021as/ptp_timestamp/ptp_ts_core.sv:ptp_ts_core: lat_corr_i — documented in ns, not named for it: lat_corr_i Per-port latency correction, ns, UNSIGNED magnitude (PTP_INGRESS_LAT on an RX tap, PTP_EGRESS_LAT on a TX tap). The DIRECTION is fixed by IS_TX so software never has to negate: RX capture - lat_corr, TX capture + lat_corr (REQ-PTP-06). 0 = disabled = today's behaviour.
