protocol-processor/hdl/packet_engine/KL_pp_nvm_port.sv:KL_pp_nvm_port: MAX_PAYLOAD_P — documented in bytes, not named for it: largest accepted payload_length in bytes; must be ≤ 65527 so that dev_len_o = 8 + payload_length always fits 16 bits
